- /home/gregz/cp/panopt/crates/panopt-zellij/src/main.rs (all changes: `PanoptPane` fields ~440-553, `update()` 681, `pipe()` 743, `reload_data()` 1131, `handle_key`/`handle_mouse` 1573/1686, `clamp_cursor` 1510, `request_focus_pane` emit pattern 1876, write helpers ~2556-2607, read helpers ~1375/2791)
